SUMMARY:IFAC WC 2029 · Conference
DESCRIPTION:World Congress of the International Federation of Automatic Con
 trol\nStatus: confirmed\, checked 2026-10-31\nOfficial source: https://co
 nferences.ifac-control.org/wc2029/\nVenue Radar: https://gon-uri.github.i
 o/venue-radar/#ifac-wc-2029\nNotes: IFAC's triennial flagship since 1960.
  The official site confirms the 24th congress at Amsterdam RAI\, July 8-1
 3\, 2029\; on 2026-10-31 it posts no call\, deadlines or submission site.
  Both deadlines keep the original 2026 lead times (Busan\, Aug 23-28)\, i
 .e. papers 270 and discussion papers 176 days before the meeting\; 2023\,
  also in July\, used Oct 31 for papers. Cutoff hours are unknown. The 202
 6 IFAC-journal option is omitted (absent in 2023). Papers appear open acc
 ess in IFAC-PapersOnLine\; discussion papers only in preprints. XL rests 
 on IFAC's up to 4\,000 attendees and 3\,206 delegates in 2023. Size is an
  editorial estimate.
